flowchart TD
  A["Venus QuickJS：关闭、退出或保存设置"] --> B["读取 `message.channel-summary`、`message.left-dialog-list`、`message.composer`、`message.member-roster` 完整 VM"]
  B --> C["Frame 内 `ActionBinding(close/leave/settings)`"]
  C --> D["native 注入 actor/requestId/observedRevision/surfaceEpoch"]
  D --> E["ActionInvocationEnvelope / HostObservation / Inbound"]
  E --> F["MobileImSdk -> CoreBridge -> helix-driver-ffi"]
  F --> G["`Tick::Command/Inbound/PortReply/Timer`"]
  G --> H["`http_write`、`storage_upsert`、`projection`、`transport_broadcast`"]
  H --> I["Go authority：`POST /api/cses/channel/change/info` body `{channelId,name?,displayName?,header?,purpose?,orient?,module?,pictureType?,picture?,source?,expectedVersion?}`；其他专用命令见 UC-5.5"]
  I --> J["WS/PortReply：`update_channel`, `update_channel_notice`"]
  J --> K["`PersistAtomic -> PersistOk`；SQLite `channel`"]
  K --> L{"PersistOk?"}
  L -- "否" --> X["保留旧 VM；ActionReceipt failed；可重试"]
  L -- "是" --> M["SurfaceComposer：`message.channel-summary`、`message.left-dialog-list`、`message.composer`、`message.member-roster`"]
  M --> N["InteractionFrameV2 schemaVersion=2"]
  N --> O["FFI batch -> C++ SurfaceRuntime 整帧校验"]
  O --> P{"epoch/revision/causation 合法?"}
  P -- "否" --> Y["保留最后一致 VM；请求 snapshot/resync"]
  P -- "是" --> Q["原子提交 ChannelSummaryVm + DialogListVm + ComposerVm + MemberRosterVm"]
  Q --> R["QuickJS im.surface.view/pending"]
  R --> S["移动 UI：设置保存后频道头、会话行和成员相关权限按 expectedVersion 原子更新"]
  S --> T["FrameApplied / directive ack / action terminal"]
